      "kind": "hypothesis",
      "title": "Investigation assessment",
      "detail": "Checkout is returning HTTP 503 with no origin telemetry. The service dependency graph shows checkout depends on payments and inventory, which in turn depend on ledger and notifications. However, no origin diagnostics (logs or request traces) are available to confirm the root cause. Current policies block all recovery actions\u2014rollback, feature flag disable, and service restart\u2014because origin diagnostics are missing. Without confirmed evidence of the failure origin, no supported action can be justified. The past operator suggestion to restart payments is uncorroborated and lacks trace data. A diagnosis is required to identify the missing diagnostic evidence before any remediation can be proposed.",
